<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="th"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %></title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><%- include('_head-style') %><%- include('_theme-init') %></head><body><main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6"><a href="/sales">← ประวัติเช่าเดิม</a><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold my-6">รายละเอียดเว็บเช่าเดิม</h1><div class="bg-[var(--card)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-xl p-5 space-y-2"><p><b><%= sale.days %> วัน · ฿<%= Number(sale.price||0).toLocaleString() %></b></p><p>คีย์: <code class="break-all"><%= sale.key %></code></p><p>หมดอายุ: <%= exp?new Date(exp).toLocaleString('th-TH',{timeZone:'Asia/Bangkok'}):'-' %></p><% if(sale.provisioning&&sale.provisioning.url){ %><a class="text-[var(--gold)]" href="<%= sale.provisioning.url %>"><%= sale.provisioning.url %></a><% } %></div><% if(sale.provisioning&&sale.provisioning.status==='success'){ %><form class="mt-5 p-5 bg-[var(--card)] rounded-xl" method="post" action="/sales/<%= encodeURIComponent(sale.id) %>/sync"><input type="password" name="railwayToken" required placeholder="Railway API Token" class="w-full bg-[var(--input)] p-2 rounded-lg"><button class="mt-3 bg-[var(--gold)] text-[var(--bg)] p-2 rounded-lg">อัปเดตเว็บเดิม</button></form><% } %></main></body></html>
